## 6. PegInsertionSide: Training & Results
Peg insertion proved significantly harder, particularly in the final precision phase.
### 6.1 Motion Planning Data Training
Training on 165 motion planning trajectories for 200 epochs showed improved rewards (~60), but terminal insertion remained unstable.
### 6.2 Resumed Training
Resuming training for an additional 250 epochs with a lower learning rate (5e-5) yielded the best results:
